Package: neoaprs
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: OH2GBA <john@oh2gba.eu>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://oh2gba.github.io/neoaprs/
Description: APRS client with a map, messages and a web page
 NeoAPRS talks to a KISS TNC (or a radio with one built in) and shows what
 it hears on a map, in a message list and on a web page, from the same
 machine or from any browser on the network. It sends the position beacon,
 messages, bulletins and objects, and runs as a service of the user.
 .
 The package holds its own CPython and libraries in /opt/neoaprs and uses
 nothing of the system's Python. After the install, run as your own user:
 neoaprs service install --linger
